  omitted, all three noindex:

    /newsletter-thanks  reachable only from the footer newsletter form.
    /library            held back behind the coming-soon banner (31 Jul 2026).
    /wellbeing          the same.

  The two held-back pages are noindex but NOT disallowed in robots.txt, and that
  is deliberate: a page blocked from crawling cannot be read, so Google never
  sees the noindex and can keep an already-indexed URL listed indefinitely. The
  crawler has to be let in to be told to go away.

